<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  暫時性檔案:Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions 0.4.0 發佈到 nuget.org 之後請刪除本檔。
  TEMPORARY: delete this file once Ozakboy.TradeKit.Abstractions 0.4.0 is published to nuget.org.

  本套件 0.2.0 需要 Abstractions 0.4.0 的條件單契約(IExchangeClient 的五個成員與
  IUserDataFeed.SubscribeConditionalOrderUpdatesAsync),而那一版尚未發佈,只以 dotnet pack
  產在本機 feed。沒有這份設定,還原會找不到 0.4.0 而整個 repo 建置不起來。
  This package's 0.2.0 needs the conditional order contract from Abstractions 0.4.0, which is not published yet
  and exists only as a local pack. Without this file the restore cannot find 0.4.0 and the repo does not build.

  clear 是必要的:沒有它,機器層級的 NuGet.config 仍然生效,而本機 feed 只是「多一個來源」——
  那在本機看起來沒問題,到了 CI 就變成「找不到套件」,而且原因藏在一層看不見的全域設定裡。
  The clear matters: without it the machine-level configuration still applies and the local feed is merely one
  more source, which looks fine locally and becomes a missing package on CI for a reason hidden in a global file.
-->
<configuration>
  <packageSources>
    <clear />
    <add key="nuget.org" value="https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json" />
    <add key="ozakboy-local" value="D:\程式專案\Ozakboy_GitHub\nuget-local-feed" />
  </packageSources>

  <!--
    還原目的地改到 repo 底下的 .nuget-packages(已進 .gitignore),不用使用者層級的全域快取。
    原因是本機 feed 的 0.4.0 還在反覆重打包,而全域快取的鍵只有「套件 id + 版號」——
    同一個版號重新打包之後,快取裡留的還是舊那一份,還原不會察覺,於是建置用的是上一次的內容,
    而錯誤會出現在「明明改了卻沒生效」這種最難懷疑到快取的地方。
    改到 repo 底下之後,這份快取跟著這個暫時狀態一起存在,也跟著一起消失。
    Restore targets a repo-local .nuget-packages (git-ignored) instead of the user-wide global cache, because
    the local feed's 0.4.0 is still being repacked and the global cache is keyed on package id and version
    alone: repacking the same version leaves the old copy in place, restore does not notice, and the build
    silently uses the previous content — a failure that looks like "the edit did not take effect" and points
    nowhere near a cache. A repo-local folder lives and dies with this temporary arrangement.

    0.4.0 發佈之後連同本檔一起刪除,還原就會回到正常的全域快取。
    Delete this file once 0.4.0 is published and restore returns to the normal global cache.
  -->
  <config>
    <add key="globalPackagesFolder" value=".nuget-packages" />
  </config>
</configuration>
